  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nMarked price = 550\n\nSelling price = 350\n\nFirst discount = 20%\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSP = MP × (1 - d₁ ÷ 100) × (1 - d₂ ÷ 100)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 350 = 550 × (1 - 20 ÷ 100) × (1 - d ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ 350 = 550 × (4 ÷ 5) × (1 - d ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ 350 = 440 × (1 - d ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ 350 ÷ 440 = (1 - d ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ 35 ÷ 44 = (1 - d ÷ 100)\n\n⇒ d ÷ 100 = 1 - 35 ÷ 44 = 9 ÷ 44\n\n⇒ d = (9 ÷ 44) × 100 = 900 ÷ 44 = 20.45\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 20.45%.**",
